g","type":"gp_Pln","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"Angleg","type":"number","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"Extractd","type":"gp_Dir","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"NPld","type":"gp_Pln","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"Angled","type":"number","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"ModifyLeft","type":"boolean","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"ModifyRight","type":"boolean","optional":false,"rest":false}],"returnType":"void","comment":"Splits the face <F> of the former given shape with the wire <W>. The wire is assumed to lie on the face.\nPuts a draft angle on both parts of the wire. <Extractg>, <Nplg>, <Angleg> define the arguments for the left part of the wire. <Extractd>, <Npld>, <Angled> define the arguments for the right part of the wire.\nThe draft angle is measured with the direction <Extract>. <Npl> defines the neutral plane (points belonging to the neutral plane are not modified). <Angle> is the value of the draft angle. If <ModifyLeft> is set to <false>, no draft angle is applied to the left part of the wire. If <ModifyRight> is set to <false>,no draft angle is applied to the right part of the wire."},{"name":"Perform","signature":"(F: TopoDS_Face, W: TopoDS_Wire, Extract: gp_Dir, NPl: gp_Pln, Angle: number): void","parameters":[{"name":"F","type":"TopoDS_Face","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"W","type":"TopoDS_Wire","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"Extract","type":"gp_Dir","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"NPl","type":"gp_Pln","optional":false,"rest":false},{"name":"Angle","type":"number","optional":false,"rest":false}],"returnType":"void","comment":"Splits the face <F> of the former given shape with the wire <W>. The wire is assumed to lie on the face. Puts a draft angle on the left part of the wire. The draft angle is measured with the direction <Extract>. <Npl> defines the neutral plane (points belonging to the neutral plane are not modified). <Angle> is the value of the draft angle."},{"name":"